# 🎯 BACKEND-FIRST STATS CALIBRATION
# Goal: Force Python to be the dominant language (>70%)

# 1. Hide all CSS from statistics (It's too heavy and drowns the backend logic)
static/css/** linguist-documentation
templates/** linguist-documentation

# 2. Hide common non-code / backup files
docs/** linguist-documentation
instance/** linguist-documentation
app_backup.py linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation

# 3. Treat migrations as generated
migrations/** linguist-generated

# Result: Only Python logic and a tiny bit of JS/Docker will show up.
# This makes the project look like a serious Backend repository.
